column2:
{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
So you truly believe that \n
{NAMEINSERT 0x0004} was brought to this \n
castle...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0002}{NAME 0x0001}
My memory fails me, but...\n
this seems to be the place...\n
Don't you believe me?\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
I know better than \n
anyone that you are not \n
the type to lie.\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0002}{NAME 0x0001}{NAMEINSERT 0x0000}...\n
{NEXTACTION}
Aaargh!! \n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
Are you all right?!\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0002}{NAME 0x0001}
I− I'm fine... it's {NAMEINSERT 0x0004}\n
you should be concerned\n
about, not me...\n
{WAITINPUT}{SAMECHAR}
Go on ahead!!\n
I'll be right behind you.\n
You have my word.\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
OK, then.\n
I'll see you inside!!\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}

{PORTRAIT 0x0004}{NAME 0x0009}
Halt!\n
The color of your soul...\n
You must be a {NAMEINSERT 0x0006}...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
That is correct.  This... \n
overwhelming power...\n
{NAMEINSERT 0x0005}...?\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{NEXTACTION}{PORTRAIT 0x0004}{NAME 0x0009}
Indeed.\n
{NAME 0x0005}{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
Which means this is, in\n
fact, {NAMEINSERT 0x0007}'s castle...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0004}{NAME 0x0005}
That might be true... \n
though the power that is \n
here is not my lord's.\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
What do you mean?!\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0004}{NAME 0x0005}
I must go now.\n
We shall meet again,\n
son of {NAMEINSERT 0x0006}...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{NEXTACTION}{COMMAND2 0x0000}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
Aaargh...\n
He... got away...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}

{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
What?! \n
You found them?!\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0002}{NAME 0x0001}
According to legend, it's\n
still too early for \n
{NAMEINSERT 0x0007}'s resurrection.\n
{WAITINPUT}{SAMECHAR}
It is not like anyone is \n
cursed right now either.\n
{WAITINPUT}{SAMECHAR}
At first, I was \n
doubtful that I could find \n
all his remains...\n
{WAITINPUT}{SAMECHAR}
But I uncovered six \n
parts, as if guided by\n
a higher being...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
That's impossible...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0002}{NAME 0x0001}
I have little memory of \n
what occurred after that, \n
but the remains have \n
{WAITINPUT}{SAMECHAR}
vanished.  I do remember\n
clearly though that {NAMEINSERT 0x0004}\n
was kidnapped...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
If true, {NAMEINSERT 0x0007}'s bodily \n
remains may be giving \n
rise to this castle...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}

{PORTRAIT 0x0002}{NAME 0x0001}
Forgive me.\n
This is all my fault...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
I'm not the one you\n
should be seeking\n
forgiveness from...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0002}{NAME 0x0001}
?!\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
You ought to apologize to\n
{NAMEINSERT 0x0004} first. We must hurry\n
and find her.\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0002}{NAME 0x0001}
Yes. Yes, you're right.\n
OK, I'll be off then.\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}{NAMEINSERT 0x0001}...\n
I believe in you.\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0002}{NAME 0x0001}
Thanks,\n
{NAMEINSERT 0x0000}...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}

{PORTRAIT 0x0003}{NAME 0x0001}
Oh, I see you are still \n
alive...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}{NAMEINSERT 0x0001}!\n
No, you're not {NAMEINSERT 0x0001}...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0003}{NAME 0x0001}
Ha...\n
You're onto me...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
What the hell are you?\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0003}{NAME 0x0001}
I am... myself...\n
just not the ‘me' that\n
you knew in the past.\n
{WAITINPUT}{SAMECHAR}
This man's suppressed \n
desires, coupled with his\n
possession of {NAMEINSERT 0x0007}'s \n
{WAITINPUT}{SAMECHAR}
remains, gave rise to\n
a separate spirit... \n
and...\n
{WAITINPUT}{SAMECHAR}
that other spirit is me.\n
I'm not sure if he's even\n
aware of my existence.\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
And it was also you\n
who kidnapped {NAMEINSERT 0x0004}?\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{NEXTACTION}{PORTRAIT 0x0003}{NAME 0x0001}
Heh−heh...\n
Of course it was my \n
doing. She belongs to me.\n
{WAITINPUT}{SAMECHAR}{NEXTACTION}
But he went and lost his \n
memory and doesn't \n
even know where she is!\n
{WAITINPUT}{SAMECHAR}
But he will retrieve his \n
memory soon!  When he \n
does, she'll be all mine.\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
Damn you!\n
{NEXTACTION}{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{NEXTACTION}{PORTRAIT 0x0003}{NAME 0x0001}
Sure about that? If I die,\n
your best friend will\n
perish with me!\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
Aaargh!\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0003}{NAME 0x0001}
Your death is at hand!\n
Die, you vile dog!\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}

{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}{NAMEINSERT 0x0004}!!\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{NEXTACTION}{PORTRAIT 0x0005}{NAME 0x0004}{NAMEINSERT 0x0000}!\n
Is it really you, {NAMEINSERT 0x0000}?!\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
Are you all right?\n
Are you injured?\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0005}{NAME 0x0004}
I'm fine. \n
{NAMEINSERT 0x0001} had me tucked \n
safely away here.\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
Oh, I see...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0005}{NAME 0x0004}
Didn't he come with you?\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}{NAMEINSERT 0x0001}'s waiting for us \n
outside, I think...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0005}{NAME 0x0004}
Hey, what happened to\n
the person that brought\n
me to this place?\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
You mean that you don't\n
know who it was that \n
kidnapped you!?\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0005}{NAME 0x0004}
Until {NAMEINSERT 0x0001} came to my\n
rescue, I− I was \n
blindfolded...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
I see...\n
Okay, let's try to get \n
out of this place...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0005}{NAME 0x0004}
Yes, let's go.\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{NEXTACTION}{PORTRAIT 0x0004}{NAME 0x0005}
So this is where you've \n
been hiding...\n
He, too, is a bold man...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{NEXTACTION}{PORTRAIT 0x0005}{NAME 0x0004}
Nooooo!\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}{NAMEINSERT 0x0004}!\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0004}{NAME 0x0005}
I shall have this maiden\n
for myself.\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{NEXTACTION}{PORTRAIT 0x0005}{NAME 0x0004}
No! {NAMEINSERT 0x0000}... save me!!\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{NEXTACTION}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
Damn!\n
I must hurry after them!\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}

{PORTRAIT 0x0004}{NAME 0x0005}
You're too late...\n
The castles will soon \n
begin to merge together...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}

{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
Stop!\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{NEXTACTION}{PORTRAIT 0x0002}{NAME 0x0001}
J− {NAMEINSERT 0x0000}, it's you...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{NEXTACTION}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}{NAMEINSERT 0x0004}, are you all right?!\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0005}{NAME 0x0004}
...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
She's lost consciousness.\n
But I think we've made\n
it here in time!\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{NEXTACTION}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}{NAMEINSERT 0x0001}!\n
You've still managed to \n
hold onto your true self.\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0002}{NAME 0x0001}
Yes, by some means or\n
another... but...\n
I've reached my limit...\n
{WAITINPUT}{SAMECHAR}
I− I beg you...\n
Take my life.\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
Wha− What do you speak \n
of? I can't...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0002}{NAME 0x0001}
I can't hang on any longer.\n
I can't fight the impulse...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
But I...\n
I cannot take your life.\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{NEXTACTION}{PORTRAIT 0x0003}{NAME 0x0001}
Then, I'll make you\n
kill me...\n
Defend yourself!\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}

{PORTRAIT 0x0002}{NAME 0x0001}
Aaargh...\n
Tha− that bracelet...\n
You wore it for me...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{NEXTACTION}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
?!\n
{NAMEINSERT 0x0001}, is that you?\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0003}{NAME 0x0001}
Wh− Why do you still live \n
within me?! I thought you\n
were dead!!\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
Remember, {NAMEINSERT 0x0001}!!\n
You're stronger\n
than this!!\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{NEXTACTION}{PORTRAIT 0x0002}{NAME 0x0001}
You− You're right... But\n
compared to the training\n
we had... this is nothing.\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0003}{NAME 0x0001}
Why!?\n
Why can I not free myself\n
of you?\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0002}{NAME 0x0001}
Because I choose not to \n
free you. {NAMEINSERT 0x0000}! Finish\n
me off!!\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0003}{NAME 0x0001}
Aaargh...\n
{NEXTACTION}
I sense a strong magic at\n
work...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{NEXTACTION}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
The− The remains...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{NEXTACTION}{PORTRAIT 0x0003}{NAME 0x0001}
As long as I have this\n
power, I have no need for \n
this body! Here, have it!\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{NEXTACTION}{PORTRAIT 0x0002}{NAME 0x0001}
Aaaaaah!!\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{NEXTACTION}{COMMAND2 0x0000}{PORTRAIT 0x0006}{NAME 0x0008}
Hmmph, I'm not stable,\n
but your blood will once\n
again make me whole.\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
Take it if you can...\n
{NEXTACTION}
Do not underestimate \n
the power of {NAMEINSERT 0x0006}...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0006}{NAME 0x0008}{NEXTACTION}
Ok, let us begin then.\n
I will enjoy destroying\n
you.\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}

{PORTRAIT 0x0006}{NAME 0x0008}
Argggh!!\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
I told you so. Do not \n
underestimate the \n
power of my bloodline!!\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0006}{NAME 0x0008}
So− So this is the power\n
of {NAMEINSERT 0x0006}...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
Vile spawn of {NAMEINSERT 0x0001}, you\n
are not worthy of being \n
my opponent.\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0006}{NAME 0x0008}
I will now fade from this\n
world... but I find some\n
pleasure in this...\n
{WAITINPUT}{SAMECHAR}
with the cursed powers of \n
yours, destiny calls you \n
to hunt for all eternity.\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}

{PORTRAIT 0x0005}{NAME 0x0004}
...\n
Oh, Ooh...\n
{NEXTACTION}{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{NEXTACTION}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
It looks like you're\n
coming to...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0005}{NAME 0x0004}
Have we...\n
been saved?\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
Yes...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{NEXTACTION}{PORTRAIT 0x0005}{NAME 0x0004}
Huh?  Where's {NAMEINSERT 0x0001}?\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
...\n
{NAMEINSERT 0x0001} is...\n
arghh...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0005}{NAME 0x0004}{NAMEINSERT 0x0000}... it's all right.\n
You don't have to say\n
anything more.\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
I... I...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0005}{NAME 0x0004}
I have no idea about what\n
happened between the two \n
of you... but you mustn't \n
{WAITINPUT}{SAMECHAR}
blame yourself. Blaming\n
yourself is the same as \n
blaming him.\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
Perhaps you're right...\n
Indeed, {NAMEINSERT 0x0001} would\n
have agreed with you...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0005}{NAME 0x0004}
At any rate, let's go \n
home. We'll figure it all\n
out after we've rested.\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
That sounds good...\n
Let's go home, {NAMEINSERT 0x0004}!\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}

{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
Damn it all! Ultimately, \n
I couldn't save Lydie or\n
{NAMEINSERT 0x0001}.\n
{WAITINPUT}{SAMECHAR}
All that remains to\n
remember them by\n
is this bracelet...\n
{WAITINPUT}{SAMECHAR}{NEXTACTION}
I couldn't even protect \n
those I love. I've failed \n
as a Vampire Hunter!\n
{WAITINPUT}{SAMECHAR}
What on earth should I do\n
with myself now...?\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}

{PORTRAIT 0x0002}{NAME 0x0001}
...\n
Wh− Where am I?\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}{NAMEINSERT 0x0001}, you've come \n
back to us...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{NEXTACTION}{PORTRAIT 0x0002}{NAME 0x0001}
Am I alive...?\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
You used your own\n
strength to force him\n
out of you.\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0002}{NAME 0x0001}
It wasn't my strength...\n
It was yours and \n
{NAMEINSERT 0x0004}'s...\n
{WAITINPUT}{SAMECHAR}{NEXTACTION}
?!\n
What about {NAMEINSERT 0x0004}?!\n
Did you save her?\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
She hasn't come to, but \n
her bite marks faded when\n
{NAMEINSERT 0x0007} was vanquished.\n
{WAITINPUT}{SAMECHAR}
She's regained some color.\n
It's just a matter of time \n
before she wakes up.\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0002}{NAME 0x0001}
I see...\n
{NAMEINSERT 0x0000}...\n
Please forgive me...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
It's all behind us now. \n
Everyone's been saved, so \n
there is nothing more to say.\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0002}{NAME 0x0001}
...\n
Thank you.\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{NEXTACTION}{PORTRAIT 0x0005}{NAME 0x0004}
...\n
Uhh... Ooh...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{NEXTACTION}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
It looks as if {NAMEINSERT 0x0004}'s \n
coming to...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{NEXTACTION}{PORTRAIT 0x0005}{NAME 0x0004}
Huh, {NAMEINSERT 0x0000}...\n
What am I doing here...?\n
{WAITINPUT}{SAMECHAR}
I think... that I...\n
was bitten by {NAMEINSERT 0x0001}...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
Calm down...you must \n
have just had a bad \n
dream.  Feel your neck.\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{NEXTACTION}{PORTRAIT 0x0005}{NAME 0x0004}
...\n
{COMMAND2 0x0000}{WAITINPUT}
There's nothing there...\n
Huh, it was just a dream.\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0002}{NAME 0x0001}
Hey, tell her the truth...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{NEXTACTION}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
Shhh! Keep quiet.\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{NEXTACTION}{PORTRAIT 0x0005}{NAME 0x0004}
What...?\n
{NAMEINSERT 0x0001}!\n
You've come back!\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0002}{NAME 0x0001}
Yes, but actually...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
Yes, {NAMEINSERT 0x0001}. I'm sure you\n
are exhausted, so let's talk \n
after we get home!\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0002}{NAME 0x0001}
No, I want to...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
Come on, {NAMEINSERT 0x0001}. Nothing\n
happened! Isn't it best \n
we leave it at that?\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0002}{NAME 0x0001}
No, that's not right!\n
You should finish what\n
you start...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{NEXTACTION}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
What did you just say!?\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{NEXTACTION}{PORTRAIT 0x0005}{NAME 0x0004}
Cut it out, you two!\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0002}{NAME 0x0001}
...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{NEXTACTION}{PORTRAIT 0x0005}{NAME 0x0004}
Stop it, both of you!\n
Don't get started.  We\n
just got together!\n
{NEXTACTION}{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0002}{NAME 0x0001}
Actually, {NAMEINSERT 0x0004}...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0005}{NAME 0x0004}
I'll hear your stories at \n
home. Until then, let's \n
talk about other things.\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
You heard the lady.\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0002}{NAME 0x0001}
...\n
{NEXTACTION}
All right...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{NEXTACTION}{PORTRAIT 0x0005}{NAME 0x0004}
Hee hee. It's been a \n
while, hasn't it, since the \n
three of us got together.\n
{NEXTACTION}{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0001}{NAME 0x0000}
Yes, it has...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}{PORTRAIT 0x0002}{NAME 0x0001}
Yes...\n
{WAITINPUT}{NEWCHAR}
